|9. Footnotes                                                                                                          |
|──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────|
|                                                                                                                      |
|Footnotes are numbered by first use[1], and a second one follows[2]. A reference to the first one again[1] reuses its |
|number.                                                                                                               |
|                                                                                                                      |
|                                                                                                                      |
|10. Raw HTML                                                                                                          |
|──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────|
|                                                                                                                      |
|<div align="center">Raw HTML blocks are shown as dimmed raw text.</div>                                               |
|                                                                                                                      |
|Inline HTML such as <kbd>Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>F</kbd> is also shown as dimmed raw text.                                  |
|                                                                                                                      |
|<!-- an HTML comment -->                                                                                              |
|                                                                                                                      |
