|12. Edge cases                                                                                                        |
|──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────|
|                                                                                                                      |
|An empty emphasis ** ** and an escaped *asterisk*, plus a backslash \ and HTML entities: & < > ©.                     |
|                                                                                                                      |
|A line with trailing spaces and a URL autolink: https://example.com/autolink.                                         |
|                                                                                                                      |
|                                                                                                                      |
|A setext heading, underlined with dashes (renders as a level 2 heading)                                               |
|──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────|
|                                                                                                                      |
|The end of the showcase. If you can read this line, the whole document has been laid out and scrolled to the bottom.  |
|                                                                                                                      |
|──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────|
|[1] The first footnote text, listed at the end of the document under a rule.                                          |
|[2] The second footnote, with styled text and a link.                                                                 |
